<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108339" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποδοχ-εῖον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>reservoir,</i> Aristeas
				<i><span class="en">
				89
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				91
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				733.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>; used for storage of (live ?) fish, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHamb.</u>
				6.10
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>; of wine, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				8.918.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				729.28
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ὑπάρχοντος λέμβου Ἀντικλεῖ ἐν
					τῷ βασιλικῷ ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PPetr.</u>
					2p.64
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>, perh. =
			<i>dock</i>); coupled with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διῶρυξ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				9.1056.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A. D.)</span>; perh. also, <i>store-house, barn,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκόπεδα καὶ ὑποδόχιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					301.11
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				86.15
			</span></i>, al. <span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, etc.: metaph.,
				<i>entrepót,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀπάμεια τῶν ἀπὸ τῆς Ἰταλίας καὶ
					τῆς Ἑλλάδος ὑ. κοινόν ἐστι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					12.8.15
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				17.1.13
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τροφῆς,</span> of the
			stomach, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.361
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>socket</i> of door-hinge, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11(2).287
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				116
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>). (In signf. <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i> written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποδόχιον</span></b> 
			(less prob. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποδοχῖον</span></b> ) in
				<i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				2pp.24,64
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				733.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, but <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποδοχεῖον </span></b> ( <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποδόχειον</span></b> ) in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				10.1126.13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>, and codd.Aristeas, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
			</span></i> ll. cc.; in signf. <i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποδοχεῖον.</span></b> )</div>
